    "detailed_description": "Set off on an enchanting Match-3 journey into an underwater realm where the everyday fades away! Explore a mesmerizing aquatic world filled with intricate Match-3 challenges that will lead you through vibrant coral gardens and beautiful submerged landscapes. <br><br>As you journey deeper, collect gleaming treasures to revive a majestic undersea estate to its former glory. Delve into the captivating depths, where mind-bending puzzles, engaging spot-the-difference scenes, and intricate jigsaw puzzles await, providing you with essential resources. Gear up at the store, equipping yourself with a range of mighty power-ups to aid your odyssey into the boundless ocean.<br><br>Discover a plethora of novel gameplay elements, including submarines, formidable walls, dynamic conveyor belts, cunning octopuses, and much more! Immerse yourself in the soothing melodies of a delightful, ambient soundtrack as you navigate the extensive array of Match-3 challenges. Your aquatic adventure beckons in &quot;Jewel Match Aquascapes&quot; - a world where tranquility meets thrilling puzzles!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Journey through 200 expansive levels!<br></li><li>Dive into 50 additional bonus levels with new game features!<br></li><li>Choose from 3 distinct play modes:  timed, relaxed, and limited moves!<br></li><li>Tailor your experience with 3 difficulty settings: normal, advanced and extreme.<br></li><li>Enhance your gameplay with an array of upgrades and powerful boosts available in the in-game shop.<br></li><li>Enjoy replayable mini-games, including engaging jigsaw puzzles and captivating spot-the-difference scenes.</li></ul>",
